abstract: >-
  Numerical profiles, benchmark configurations, agreement measures and
  performance summaries for ten one-dimensional Richards equation benchmark
  cases, together with the Python analysis and plotting workflow used to
  validate the archived values and recreate the corresponding figures and
  tables.
keywords:
  - Richards equation
